flowchart TD
    K[Key press] --> H{Help open?}
    H -- yes --> HP[Pager]
    H -- no --> P{Prompt open?}
    P -- yes --> PP[Prompt input]
    P -- no --> T{Editing text?}
    T -- yes --> TE[Text edit]
    T -- no --> C{Picking color?}
    C -- yes --> CP[Palette]
    C -- no --> B{Brush character armed?}
    B -- yes --> BP[Set brush]
    B -- no --> TK{Tool key?}
    TK -- yes --> ST[Set tool]
    TK -- no --> CK[Canvas keys]
